   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">(i) Status of nationally determined contributions, national mid-century strategies and NAPs communicated to the UNFCCC in 6 EaP countries; (ii) Level of institutional capacities in the six EaP countries for the implementation of the Paris Agreement; (iii) Level of alignment with EU acquis as provided by bilateral agreements with EU and in the framework of Energy Community Treaty; (iv) Level of mobilization of new climate finance resources by countries (including under NIF/NIP) since the start of the project, EUR.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2019">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">NA</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Country offices with developing of strategic climate policies. At least one NDC is developed; one roadmap to develop a Low Emissions development strategy developed. Four regional workshops and a study tour to European Environmental Agency conducted.
Develop strategic roadmaps for alignment with EU climate change acquis in three countries.
Develop the project&#x2019;s Communications and visibility plan. Develop project&#x2019;s website.
Develop project&#x2019;s Gender action plan.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Second NDC of Moldova was developed and submitted to UNFCCC in March 2020. Roadmap for the development of the LEDS of Azerbaijan developed in December 2020.

Five regional capacity building events conducted:
- Regional workshop on MRV conducted in Vienna, Austria in February 2020
- Regional study tour to European Environmental Agency conducted in Copenhagen, Denmark in February 2020
- Regional workshop on climate finance frameworks and climate budgeting was conducted as a two-day webinar in May 2020
- Regional workshop on LEDS and Mainstreaming conducted online in October 2020
- Regional workshop on Adaptation planning conducted online in November 2020

Strategic roadmaps for alignment with EU climate change acquis developed for Georgia, Moldova and Ukraine.
The project&#x2019;s Communications and visibility plan developed and approved by the Steering committee in June 2020. 
Project&#x2019;s website developed and became operational in September 2020.
Project&#x2019;s Gender action plan developed and approved by the Steering committee in October 2020.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
